    <h1>About Us</h1>
    <p>
      Ridgeway Services & Construction Ltd. is a family-owned commercial construction company 
      with over 30 years of experience delivering quality retail, restaurant, office, and 
      tenant improvement projects. Built on trust, craftsmanship, and strong relationships, 
      we provide reliable construction solutions from concept to completion.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-full" data-reveal-group>
  <div class="container-interior">
    <p data-reveal>
      Ridgeway Services & Construction Ltd. is a proud family-owned and operated company 
      with over 30 years of experience in the commercial construction industry. Many of 
      our dedicated team members are family, and that spirit of trust, commitment, and 
      collaboration is reflected in everything we do.
    </p>

    <p data-reveal>
      We specialize in Commercial Retail Design, Engineering, and Construction, with a 
      strong focus on working directly with landlords and leasing agents. Our expertise 
      lies in interpreting Landlord Work Schedules within lease agreements and transforming 
      them into detailed scopes of work with accurate cost estimates. This streamlined 
      approach helps expedite lease execution and ensures that all landlord responsibilities 
      are met throughout the construction process.
    </p>

    <p data-reveal>
      Our team includes a full-time office staff of 10 and a field staff of 20 experienced 
      professionals—site superintendents, carpenters, framers, drywallers, painters, and 
      general laborers—all highly skilled in retail construction, store fixturing, 
      restaurant builds, office build-outs, and tenant fit-ups.
    </p>

    <p data-reveal>
      We handle a wide range of projects, from individual retail stores, restaurants, 
      offices, and daycares to full ground-up construction of new strip plazas and pad 
      site buildings.
    </p>

    {% include "stats.njk" %}

    <h2 class="sub" data-reveal>Our History</h2>
    <p data-reveal>
      Ridgeway Services & Construction Ltd. began over 30 years ago as a family-run business 
      built on strong values, hard work, and a commitment to quality. Founded with a clear 
      focus on commercial construction, our company has grown steadily—both in size and 
      reputation—while remaining true to its roots.
    </p>

    <p data-reveal>
      What started as a small team has evolved into a full-service operation with over 30 
      dedicated professionals, including site superintendents, skilled tradespeople, and 
      a strong office support staff. Many of our team members are family, and that 
      close-knit foundation has helped us foster long-standing relationships with clients, 
      landlords, and leasing agents alike.
    </p>

    <p data-reveal>
      Over the decades, we've carved out a niche in commercial retail design, engineering, 
      and construction—handling everything from tenant fit-ups and office build-outs to 
      restaurants, daycares, and full ground-up strip plaza developments. We specialize 
      in interpreting complex lease agreements and landlord work schedules, translating 
      them into clear scopes of work and ensuring smooth, cost-effective execution from 
      start to finish.
    </p>

    <p data-reveal>
      As the industry has evolved, so have we—growing our capabilities while maintaining 
      the same personalized service and hands-on approach that set us apart from day one. 
      Today, Ridgeway continues to be a trusted partner in commercial construction, known 
      for quality, reliability, and a strong commitment to getting the job done right.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

